  {"date": "2021-08-11", "venue": "Hersheypark Stadium", "city": "Hershey", "state": "PA", "gap": 5, "set": "2", "jamchart": true, "jam": "Much like the also-superb 7/9/16 \"DWD\", mainly stays within the envelope of the usual \"BOAF\" jam at first, but finds some interesting avenues within thanks to Trey's handy effects pedals. Moves into major key with Page switching to electric piano and Trey playing some repeating notes, then Fish kicks into high gear and Trey briefly switches to chords before tearing off some gnarly solos. Moves into a stranger 2.0-esque zone with Trey building up a wall of sound with his effects, Fish really urging him on, then cools down and heads back to \"BOAF\" proper (a thing that happened a lot this year). Strong version from one of the Summer's strongest shows.", "prev": "Theme from the Bottom", "in": ">", "next": "Bug", "nb": 1},
